        "created_at": "2016-05-01T14:12:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>On the alternate condition: I think it involves Apostate somehow. This is largely because the front side of Skinwalker Gloomweaver’s card has the Runes of Malediction  on it.</p>\n<p>Perhaps it’s something like losing to Apostate while the Runes of Malediction are in play. But there has to be more than that.</p>\n<p>Question: If you already have the Skinwalker unlocked, how will you know if you discover the second condition?</p>",
